      "ArticleTitle": "Erectile dysfunction and testosterone screening with prostate specific antigen screening at age 40: are these three gender specific determinants additive for overall men's heath and do they improve traditional non-gender specific determinants to lessen cardiovascular risk and all-cause mortality?",
